WEBVTT

01:34.520 --> 01:36.400
A rabbit cannot kill a tiger in one bite.

01:37.400 --> 01:39.080
But as long as it isn't found,

01:39.960 --> 01:41.520
it can keep biting.

01:42.920 --> 01:45.880
And there will come a day
when it kills the tiger.

01:48.520 --> 01:49.520
General Niu,

01:50.040 --> 01:52.760
the investigation has confirmed
that this is indeed Shu Red Silk.

01:55.160 --> 01:57.680
What about the Shu Red plaque
at the entrance to the Brocade Bureau?

01:59.000 --> 02:02.320
It should be changed to Mr. Zhao's name.

02:05.400 --> 02:06.480
Very well.

02:31.080 --> 02:34.760
ZHAO MANOR

02:37.920 --> 02:38.960
Yingying!

02:58.600 --> 03:01.960
Did you really dye the fake Shu Red?

03:05.560 --> 03:06.520
I do, now.

03:10.040 --> 03:11.840
You know what I care about the most.

03:12.800 --> 03:14.040
Yet you ruined it with your own actions.

03:18.800 --> 03:19.720
Zhao Xiuyuan,

03:21.240 --> 03:22.720
I wish that we hadn't met.

03:27.680 --> 03:28.520
Yingying,

03:31.800 --> 03:34.240
do not go up against those
you aren't able to defeat.

03:35.280 --> 03:38.440
You will only end up hurting yourself.
Put a stop to this.

03:38.520 --> 03:41.960
This is your wedding day.
You should say that to your new wife.

03:54.960 --> 03:56.640
Of course I know

03:57.160 --> 03:59.840
that the fake Shu Red
is a knife pointing towards you.

04:01.320 --> 04:04.720
But if I didn't pick up this knife,

04:04.800 --> 04:06.640
someone else would do it too.

04:09.720 --> 04:14.120
COLOR FORMULA

04:30.520 --> 04:32.800
Yingying, stop reading it.

04:32.880 --> 04:34.560
Finish the noodles first.

04:34.640 --> 04:37.360
Leave the rest for tomorrow.

04:40.640 --> 04:41.680
Mother,

04:43.120 --> 04:44.640
it was Shu Red Silk.

04:48.560 --> 04:50.920
That was Father's Shu Red Silk.

04:53.160 --> 04:56.760
He is General Niu,
the Vice Commander of a whole state.

04:56.840 --> 04:58.520
He can twist facts
and control everyone's fate

04:58.600 --> 04:59.840
just because he is a Vice Commander?

05:00.520 --> 05:03.600
Ji Yingying,
how many times have I told you?

05:03.680 --> 05:06.520
Don't bring up Shu Red Silk again.
Why can't you keep that in mind?

05:15.440 --> 05:17.600
Finish the noodles and get some rest.

05:30.800 --> 05:33.240
Ting, keep a close eye on her.

05:33.320 --> 05:34.800
You can't let anything happen to her.

05:36.040 --> 05:37.280
Yes, Mom.

06:39.200 --> 06:41.920
BELOVED HUSBAND
JI GUINAN'S MEMORIAL TABLET

06:51.400 --> 06:52.480
Guinan,

06:53.800 --> 06:55.480
I hope you won't blame me.

06:56.560 --> 06:59.920
I only want our family
to have a safe and peaceful life.

07:26.200 --> 07:27.040
Father!

07:31.920 --> 07:32.840
Father!

07:43.720 --> 07:44.800
Father…

07:56.920 --> 07:57.960
Father!

07:58.960 --> 08:02.960
I am sorry!
I could not protect your Shu Red Silk!

08:14.320 --> 08:16.200
- Father…
- Yingying?

08:17.840 --> 08:19.640
Don't be scared, Yingying.

08:36.080 --> 08:37.520
No!

09:22.920 --> 09:24.080
Father…

09:26.320 --> 09:27.600
I'm sorry…

09:29.600 --> 09:30.720
I'm sorry!

09:34.320 --> 09:36.000
Father, I'm sorry…

09:41.360 --> 09:43.160
Father, I'm sorry!

09:57.200 --> 09:59.720
Feel free to come to me
whenever you decide

10:01.080 --> 10:02.200
to look into your father's case.

10:18.160 --> 10:19.880
Yaoting, help me.

10:29.040 --> 10:33.520
BROCADE BUREAU

10:36.240 --> 10:39.720
FLUSHED ROSE, JI YINGYING
SHU RED, ZHAO XIUYUAN

11:19.640 --> 11:22.440
A rabbit cannot kill a tiger in one bite.

11:26.560 --> 11:27.840
But as long as it isn't found…

11:27.920 --> 11:29.920
It can keep biting.

11:30.000 --> 11:32.120
And there will come a day
when it kills the tiger.

11:33.320 --> 11:34.520
Future friend?

11:38.000 --> 11:39.120
Future friend.

11:45.520 --> 11:48.280
- Who threw that at me?
- Help me, sir! He is a kidnapper!

11:49.080 --> 11:50.720
Naughty girl! You are lying again!

11:51.400 --> 11:54.800
He is wearing Hanguang brocade.
It is as expensive as gold.

11:54.880 --> 11:57.840
If you call yourself my father,
you should pay him back on my behalf!

11:57.920 --> 11:58.960
Pay for it.

12:00.920 --> 12:04.280
My child has been acting out.
Allow me to apologize on her behalf.

12:04.360 --> 12:06.160
I truly cannot afford
to pay for your outfit.

12:06.240 --> 12:09.280
We spent all our money
on her mother's medical bills.

12:09.360 --> 12:12.120
Mister, please forgive us
out of the kindness of your heart.

12:12.200 --> 12:15.080
The poor family's life is not easy.

12:15.760 --> 12:17.680
- Just forgive him!
- Forgive him!

12:17.760 --> 12:19.320
- Forgive him!
- Forgive him!

12:19.400 --> 12:20.560
Give her to me as the compensation then.

12:22.880 --> 12:24.760
- Hurry up and go home with me!
- Let me go!

12:24.840 --> 12:27.000
- Hey!
- Your daughter?

12:27.080 --> 12:29.520
Do you know how old she is?
Does she have any scars on her body?

12:29.600 --> 12:31.040
Do you know what she likes to eat
or what she cannot eat?

12:31.120 --> 12:32.800
Should we head to the magistrate
and clear this up?

12:33.400 --> 12:35.240
Mister, there's no need for that!

12:45.160 --> 12:47.200
- Good!
- Good! Impressive!

12:53.960 --> 12:55.960
Mr. Yang,
your father just lost his temper.

12:56.040 --> 12:58.600
That's why he was a little harsh
and punished you more severely!

12:59.120 --> 13:02.160
The messenger only said
that the soldiers surrounded your house!

13:02.240 --> 13:03.200
Perhaps there is a mistake!

13:09.560 --> 13:11.760
- You again?
- It's you.

13:11.840 --> 13:15.440
Something happened at my home!
Please give me a ride!

13:26.160 --> 13:28.520
If my family survives this crisis,

13:29.360 --> 13:31.120
I will definitely befriend you formally.

13:33.080 --> 13:36.080
I will give you a ride
since you are my future friend.

13:39.960 --> 13:41.280
Father!

13:43.320 --> 13:45.200
A rabbit cannot kill a tiger in one bite.

13:46.480 --> 13:48.000
But as long as it isn't found,

13:48.760 --> 13:50.640
it can keep biting.

13:51.720 --> 13:54.720
And there will come a day
when it kills the tiger.

14:05.920 --> 14:07.160
When did you realize it was me?

14:08.240 --> 14:10.720
The day after Sang Shisi went riding
by Huanhua Creek.

14:11.440 --> 14:12.560
The second time we met.

14:13.720 --> 14:14.840
Why didn't you tell me?

14:18.200 --> 14:20.960
Did you already know
they were faking Shu red

14:21.040 --> 14:23.080
and showed it to me at the dyehouse?

14:25.520 --> 14:28.640
Did you also know the Niu family
was involved in my father's death?

14:31.560 --> 14:34.800
You do not tell me anything.
You keep everything from me.

14:34.880 --> 14:36.000
You scoundrel!

14:45.400 --> 14:46.360
You have mastered it.

14:47.440 --> 14:49.880
- This is the first time I use it.
- It will not work on me.

14:59.600 --> 15:00.760
What I am doing right now

15:02.640 --> 15:03.720
is really dangerous.

15:03.800 --> 15:04.800
Are you going to stop me

15:04.880 --> 15:06.160
from fighting a battle
I cannot possibly win?

15:09.520 --> 15:12.880
All I want you to know
is that you are not alone in this.

15:12.960 --> 15:14.120
Even if you fall,

15:14.200 --> 15:16.080
you should know
where to fall to secure your life.

15:24.480 --> 15:27.440
You knew I would come.
You were waiting for me just now.

15:27.520 --> 15:28.560
Not entirely.

15:29.200 --> 15:30.800
What did you discover on the mountain?

15:32.480 --> 15:33.840
Some people keep
transporting silk to the mountains.

15:34.720 --> 15:36.200
What do you think they are up to?

15:36.280 --> 15:38.840
The piece of fabric I showed you that day

15:39.360 --> 15:40.800
came from their clothing.

15:40.880 --> 15:43.200
I have sent someone to scout the mountains

15:43.720 --> 15:45.080
to locate the spot you mentioned.

15:45.160 --> 15:46.600
- Once we find something…
- What will you do?

15:48.360 --> 15:52.320
"No matter the opposition,
I will go where justice leads."

15:56.160 --> 15:57.320
Yang Jinglan,

15:59.200 --> 16:01.560
- promise me one thing.
- What do you want me to do?

16:01.640 --> 16:04.160
- Let us work together.
- Work together?

16:04.240 --> 16:06.520
I can help you look
into whatever you need.

16:07.240 --> 16:10.480
But before we team up, I need to know

16:11.000 --> 16:12.960
if your benefactor
can protect the Ji family.

16:19.760 --> 16:21.480
How did you know I have a benefactor?

16:23.040 --> 16:24.440
Could I not have done it by myself?

16:24.520 --> 16:26.400
How could you have become
a brocade officer on your own?

16:31.240 --> 16:35.440
I will use my own strength to protect you.

16:38.520 --> 16:40.240
I can take care of myself.

16:42.440 --> 16:44.520
I want to dye the true Shu Red Silk.

16:45.480 --> 16:46.560
Will you help me?

17:03.920 --> 17:06.560
After my father's death,
I cannot stand the sight of blood.

17:06.640 --> 17:08.359
The sight of flowing red terrifies me.

17:08.880 --> 17:09.760
That is the reason

17:09.839 --> 17:12.119
why I've never succeeded
in dyeing Shu Red Silk.

17:13.280 --> 17:16.160
Back then, both of us
witnessed my father's death.

17:16.839 --> 17:20.000
Yang Jinglan, help me overcome this fear.

17:22.520 --> 17:25.480
No matter what happens to me later,
do not stop.

17:26.920 --> 17:28.040
Alright!

17:57.480 --> 18:00.640
That is mine! My father left this for me!

18:02.240 --> 18:03.560
- Ji Yingying!
- Stay away!

18:08.640 --> 18:10.200
Father, it is your name.

18:10.280 --> 18:11.560
SHU RED SILK, JI GUINAN

18:11.640 --> 18:13.480
Please, everyone,

18:13.560 --> 18:15.240
take a close look
at the red silk in your hands.

18:15.320 --> 18:16.560
This is Shu Red Silk.

18:16.640 --> 18:18.640
- It is Shu Red Silk!
- It is Shu Red Silk!

18:19.440 --> 18:21.000
Her father created this silk,

18:21.640 --> 18:22.560
which had been lost for years.

18:23.520 --> 18:24.760
Now that someone else has dyed it,

18:24.840 --> 18:28.200
it is only natural for her
to find it hard to accept.

18:43.680 --> 18:44.720
Continue!

19:03.240 --> 19:05.440
Do not go up against those
you cannot defeat.

19:05.520 --> 19:07.480
You will only end up hurting yourself.

19:07.560 --> 19:08.760
Put a stop to this.

19:09.360 --> 19:11.880
Ji Guinan is hereby sentenced
to immediate execution

19:11.960 --> 19:14.240
for presenting inferior goods as tribute,
deceiving the emperor,

19:14.320 --> 19:16.000
and resisting arrest!

20:01.040 --> 20:04.520
Father… I am sorry.

20:06.840 --> 20:09.880
I could not protect your Shu Red Silk.

20:15.440 --> 20:16.600
Father.

20:22.680 --> 20:23.880
Yingying, do not be afraid.

20:26.640 --> 20:28.600
This is not just the color of blood,

20:29.120 --> 20:33.360
it is also the color of Shu Red Silk.

20:37.360 --> 20:38.200
Hold this.

21:25.760 --> 21:27.040
Father!

21:28.520 --> 21:30.000
I am not afraid!

21:34.920 --> 21:36.280
Father…

21:37.080 --> 21:38.280
I am not afraid.

21:56.560 --> 21:58.080
Father, I am not afraid.

22:08.400 --> 22:10.760
I can surely dye Shu Red Silk.

22:40.120 --> 22:43.040
THE ZHAO RESIDENCE

22:54.840 --> 22:56.840
Is this the new Shu Red
from a few days ago?

22:59.200 --> 23:00.400
Yes, Mr. Zhao.

23:01.000 --> 23:02.160
Who told you to change it?

23:02.800 --> 23:04.160
Ms. Niu did.

23:06.200 --> 23:09.160
Ms. Niu told us to replace
all the red silk with Shu Red Silk.

23:10.200 --> 23:12.360
- Should we change it back?
- No. Just go on.

23:13.040 --> 23:13.920
Yes, sir.

23:16.120 --> 23:18.280
Dear, you sure are receptive
to suggestions.

23:24.760 --> 23:27.960
Since it has been decided,
what is the point of hesitating?

23:29.880 --> 23:31.200
Rest assured, dear.

23:31.280 --> 23:33.920
The Zhao family will definitely become
the Brocade Master this year.

24:08.600 --> 24:11.800
Soak the safflower overnight,
then wash it with mugwort ash.

24:12.320 --> 24:13.160
Rinse with millet gruel,

24:13.240 --> 24:14.120
followed by a second wash
with mugwort ash.

24:14.200 --> 24:16.040
Set the color with black plum,
and you will have Shu Red.

24:16.120 --> 24:17.320
Everything is correct.

24:22.160 --> 24:24.360
- Yaoting.
- Did you fail again?

24:24.440 --> 24:27.680
I wish I had paid more attention
when Father was teaching me back then.

24:29.520 --> 24:33.200
Perhaps it is due to the variation
in time and temperature.

24:34.640 --> 24:36.800
Though I have not been able
to dye Shu Red all these years,

24:36.880 --> 24:38.720
I have never stopped researching it.

24:39.240 --> 24:42.400
Based on my experience,
the ingredients might still be the issue.

24:47.160 --> 24:50.000
Is it possible that Father
forgot to tell you something?

24:55.200 --> 24:57.880
If someone else can recreate
a similar Shu Red,

24:57.960 --> 25:00.720
then they must have
Shu Red's secret formula too.

25:01.360 --> 25:02.720
Perhaps Father predicted

25:02.800 --> 25:05.080
that Shu Red's secret formula
would be leaked,

25:05.160 --> 25:06.640
but I was still too young at that time.

25:07.280 --> 25:09.000
It was not that he forgot to tell me,

25:09.520 --> 25:10.800
but he just could not.

25:13.440 --> 25:14.320
No.

25:14.840 --> 25:16.320
Father might have
kept secrets from others,

25:16.400 --> 25:17.840
but he would never hide anything from us.

25:18.560 --> 25:19.760
He had never lied.

25:20.480 --> 25:22.880
He must have shared
the complete formula with us.

25:22.960 --> 25:24.600
We just have not found it out yet.

25:36.360 --> 25:39.040
SOAK THE SAFFLOWER OVERNIGHT
THEN WASH IT WITH MUGWORT ASH

25:39.120 --> 25:41.040
"Soak the safflower overnight,
then wash it with mugwort ash.

25:41.120 --> 25:42.520
Rinse with millet gruel…"

25:44.080 --> 25:46.840
"Soak the safflower overnight,
then wash it with mugwort ash.

25:46.920 --> 25:48.320
Rinse with millet gruel,

25:48.400 --> 25:49.800
followed by a second wash
with mugwort ash.

25:49.880 --> 25:52.720
Set the color with black plum,
and you will have Shu Red."

25:53.920 --> 25:55.120
Do you remember it?

25:55.200 --> 25:58.040
This pouch has heard everything
you just recited.

25:58.680 --> 26:02.160
If you forget the content in the future,
just ask it.

26:02.240 --> 26:03.160
Do you understand?

26:19.360 --> 26:20.360
Cut it open.

26:28.120 --> 26:31.000
I wish to be a southern branch
Lifting your gown with a soft touch

26:31.080 --> 26:32.400
What does this mean?

26:32.480 --> 26:34.520
This is a poem by Poet Qinglian,

26:34.600 --> 26:36.080
titled Ode to the Neighbor's Girl
by the East Window, and the Pomegranate.

26:36.160 --> 26:38.440
It is said that he wrote it
out of his thoughts of his daughter.

26:38.520 --> 26:40.000
This poem means

26:40.080 --> 26:41.720
that I wish to be a southern branch
of the pomegranate tree

26:41.800 --> 26:44.160
with leaves that gently nod and bow,
lifting your gown with a soft touch.

26:45.240 --> 26:46.560
This poem is not widely known.

26:47.880 --> 26:51.720
Father specifically taught it to me
after he gave you this pouch.

26:55.000 --> 26:58.440
He left the pouch to me
and taught you the poem.

26:59.240 --> 27:01.360
We can only understand
what he meant when we work together.

27:04.200 --> 27:05.600
I wish to be a southern branch

27:07.040 --> 27:08.720
Lifting your gown with a soft touch

27:10.880 --> 27:12.480
Southern branch…

27:13.760 --> 27:14.800
Pomegranate…

27:16.960 --> 27:17.880
Pomegranate?

27:19.160 --> 27:20.920
I remember seeing pomegranates
in the dyehouse when I was young.

27:21.000 --> 27:23.960
I even secretly tasted one.
Father had picked them from the mountains,

27:24.040 --> 27:25.600
but they were so sour
that I almost threw them away.

27:25.680 --> 27:27.880
Father said I could not throw them
because the sour pomegranates were useful.

27:32.040 --> 27:33.160
He was right!

27:33.920 --> 27:35.440
It really helped me remember everything!

27:36.120 --> 27:38.680
Father did not lie to me!
Yaoting, we finally remember everything!

27:39.400 --> 27:40.680
Yaoting!

27:41.680 --> 27:43.680
Father did not lie to me!

27:44.680 --> 27:47.840
Yaoting, I will make sure the world knows

27:47.920 --> 27:50.360
that Shu Red Silk
was dyed by our Ji family!

27:50.440 --> 27:51.480
Great!

29:14.240 --> 29:16.560
Are you not dyeing fabric at home?
What are you doing here?

29:17.320 --> 29:20.000
I am looking for the last ingredient.
Why are you here?

29:20.080 --> 29:21.080
Me?

29:21.600 --> 29:22.640
Well, I am with my… several friends.

29:22.720 --> 29:24.000
- Mr. Yang!
- We are here to…

29:24.680 --> 29:27.080
Do you two… know each other?

29:29.800 --> 29:32.160
Yes, we do! She…

29:32.240 --> 29:34.360
Do not say anything! Let me guess.

29:34.440 --> 29:35.280
GAO FANG, A RANGER

29:35.360 --> 29:38.480
You must be Ms. Ji from Sandaoyan, right?

29:39.760 --> 29:41.720
Yes, I am Ms. Ji from Sandaoyan.

29:41.800 --> 29:44.880
- I am right!
- So, you are Ms. Ji!

29:44.960 --> 29:47.240
Ms. Ji, it is nice to finally meet you.

29:47.320 --> 29:48.840
- Nice to meet you!
- It is nice to meet you!

29:48.920 --> 29:51.360
Ms. Ji, your name
is often seen in this man's…

29:51.440 --> 29:52.760
Two jars of Wen Jun's Wine!

29:53.840 --> 29:55.120
- Two jars?!
- Two jars?!

29:55.200 --> 29:56.520
- Two jars are not enough!
- That's not enough.

29:56.600 --> 29:58.040
Ms. Ji, you know what?

29:58.120 --> 29:59.600
We have known him for so many years,
but we have never seen…

29:59.680 --> 30:00.720
Three jars!

30:01.480 --> 30:02.880
- Three jars?!
- Three jars?!

30:05.280 --> 30:07.760
Ms. Ji, since you are Mr. Yang's friend,

30:07.840 --> 30:09.280
you are considered our friend too.

30:09.360 --> 30:11.840
Let us know if you need help.
We would be more than happy to help.

30:12.680 --> 30:13.600
Thank you very much.

30:13.680 --> 30:16.600
Well, that sounds reasonable,
but it is unnecessary.

30:16.680 --> 30:19.160
Ms. Ji will get what she needs herself.

30:28.080 --> 30:28.960
Mr. Yang!

30:29.040 --> 30:31.200
I just remembered one more thing!
Should I tell Ms. Ji about it too?

30:31.960 --> 30:33.040
Ten jars!

30:39.280 --> 30:41.960
HUANHUA DYEHOUSE

32:14.320 --> 32:16.120
THE TOMB OF SHEN RUFENG
THE BROCADE OFFICER

32:18.200 --> 32:21.360
I am here to see you again, old man.

32:21.440 --> 32:23.120
So, do not go around
saying I am a bad student.

32:26.040 --> 32:28.840
Take a good look at these.
I've brought the food you like.

32:29.360 --> 32:31.960
Roasted chicken, steamed duck,
and this one.

32:32.040 --> 32:33.760
Your favorite tofu stew.

32:34.360 --> 32:36.200
I made this dish myself.

32:37.280 --> 32:38.320
By the way,

32:38.840 --> 32:40.560
I've also brought food
for the two of you, brocade officers.

32:42.440 --> 32:45.760
I wonder if the two of you were killed
by someone like my master

32:46.280 --> 32:48.320
or if you made a deal with a tiger,
only to end up as its prey.

33:01.800 --> 33:04.600
Master Shen, do not worry about me.

33:06.440 --> 33:09.640
No matter how treacherous Yizhou may be
or what dangers await,

33:10.160 --> 33:11.760
I will have to face them myself.

33:11.840 --> 33:14.480
If you are watching over me from above,

33:15.000 --> 33:18.400
please guide me to find clues
here on Mount Qingcheng

33:19.480 --> 33:21.240
and bring justice for you soon.

33:52.360 --> 33:53.720
Master!

33:53.800 --> 33:56.040
We will be arriving in Yizhou soon.

34:10.239 --> 34:11.560
Excellent!

34:13.239 --> 34:14.600
- Awesome!
- Nice!

34:14.679 --> 34:15.679
DEITY TABLET OF LEIZU

34:18.159 --> 34:19.400
All of you are here.

34:20.679 --> 34:23.440
Mr. Sang, didn't your father book a room?

34:23.520 --> 34:25.360
It must be uncomfortable
for you to be here.

34:26.480 --> 34:28.280
I love being with you guys.
Is there a problem?

34:28.360 --> 34:29.880
Make space for me.

34:29.960 --> 34:33.760
- I will just stand here.
- Stop crowding me. How annoying.

34:35.159 --> 34:36.440
Thank you for your help today.

34:36.520 --> 34:39.520
If you hadn't helped us,
we would be meeting in jail right now.

34:41.960 --> 34:45.920
You like to joke around,
but you're a kind and loyal friend.

34:47.600 --> 34:49.040
I truly mean it.

34:49.120 --> 34:50.280
Really?

34:51.560 --> 34:52.679
Pin,

34:53.400 --> 34:56.560
this is the first time
someone has ever praised me like this.

34:58.040 --> 35:00.080
Pin, you're a good girl.

35:00.160 --> 35:01.600
I have made up my mind.

35:02.480 --> 35:04.400
I will be your hero.

35:30.280 --> 35:31.680
BROCADE WEAVING COMPETITION

35:35.240 --> 35:38.000
The Brocade Weaving Competition
of Yizhou Brocade Bureau,

35:38.600 --> 35:41.200
held on the ninth of the tenth month,
where a new Brocade Master will be chosen.

35:42.280 --> 35:45.440
Let the event officially begin!

35:45.520 --> 35:48.320
First, let's welcome
our former Brocade Master,

35:48.400 --> 35:50.560
the Yang family, to present their brocade!

35:54.680 --> 35:57.560
I, Yang Jingshan
from the Yang family, present the brocade,

35:57.640 --> 35:59.320
"Heavenly Beauty".

36:01.720 --> 36:05.200
For over a hundred years, my family has
upheld the tradition of brocade-making.

36:05.280 --> 36:08.720
Every member of the family, young and old,
is focused on creating new designs.

36:09.240 --> 36:12.480
This year's brocade features a design

36:12.560 --> 36:15.560
where the most important element
is the peony,

36:15.640 --> 36:18.880
with ten colors, each uniquely different.

36:18.960 --> 36:20.320
Excellent!

36:21.080 --> 36:26.640
- Yang Brocade!
- Yang Brocade!

36:26.720 --> 36:32.440
- Yang Brocade!
- Yang Brocade!

36:32.520 --> 36:35.520
The Yang Brocade is truly one of a kind.

36:38.000 --> 36:41.280
It doesn't matter if it's a new design
or if the peonies are uniquely different.

36:42.200 --> 36:45.200
The Zhao family will definitely be
the Brocade Master this year.

36:45.720 --> 36:46.960
That's right.

36:47.040 --> 36:49.080
Wuniang, with your blessing,

36:49.160 --> 36:52.200
Xiuyuan will definitely win.

37:06.680 --> 37:07.600
There is no use waiting.

37:08.720 --> 37:12.320
Ms. Ji has been locking herself
at home for some time.

37:12.880 --> 37:15.200
She must be preparing for her marriage.

37:22.240 --> 37:24.760
Grandpa, I am leaving
to present the brocade now.

37:26.400 --> 37:27.440
Xiuyuan,

37:32.160 --> 37:35.480
your father has been preparing
for today for a long time,

37:35.560 --> 37:36.400
but his hard work
has taken a toll on his health,

37:36.480 --> 37:37.720
so he could not come in person.

37:38.400 --> 37:40.920
However, he is waiting at home
for good news from you.

37:42.600 --> 37:44.480
Please do not disappoint him.

37:46.480 --> 37:47.360
You can go now.

38:08.120 --> 38:09.320
Ms. Ji has not arrived.

38:10.480 --> 38:11.760
As for the mountain…

38:14.960 --> 38:17.520
Everything is set.
We just need the final piece.

38:19.880 --> 38:21.840
But to be safe, Zhuge,

38:22.680 --> 38:24.520
please find one more person for me.
Come closer.

39:09.880 --> 39:11.560
We have finally found their hideout.

39:16.840 --> 39:20.120
The Yang family is indeed impressive.
The peonies look real.

39:20.760 --> 39:22.680
The brocade from the Zou family
is impressive too.

39:22.760 --> 39:24.280
The peacock looks just as lifelike.

39:24.360 --> 39:25.680
It looks like it will fly
out of the fabric soon.

39:26.200 --> 39:27.320
The brocade contest
is about craftsmanship,

39:27.400 --> 39:30.040
not about who can make it
look the most lifelike.

39:30.120 --> 39:32.000
I think the Yu family's piece
is quite good.

39:32.080 --> 39:33.000
It has a certain elegance to it.

39:33.080 --> 39:34.840
The brocade from the Yu family
feels a bit outdated.

39:39.920 --> 39:43.640
"Like the great roc soaring with the wind
Ascending to the heavens!"

39:44.160 --> 39:45.560
Please, everyone,
feast your eyes on our brocade!

39:52.920 --> 39:54.680
The brocade is rather pretty.

40:15.920 --> 40:17.560
How boring.

40:17.640 --> 40:19.360
It is indeed a good one.

40:19.880 --> 40:20.720
It looks normal.

40:32.880 --> 40:33.720
Mr. Yang,

40:34.760 --> 40:37.120
the Yang family's
"Heavenly Beauty" displays

40:37.200 --> 40:39.880
remarkable technique and elegance,

40:41.000 --> 40:43.280
while the Zhao family's concept
is exceptional,

40:43.880 --> 40:47.520
with a color palette
that's truly masterful.

40:47.600 --> 40:51.120
We cannot decide just yet.

40:51.200 --> 40:52.840
What is your opinion…?

40:58.840 --> 40:59.920
You're right!

41:00.880 --> 41:03.680
Both families' brocades
have their own unique qualities.

41:03.760 --> 41:07.200
In my opinion, since it is still early

41:07.720 --> 41:08.800
and we are finding it difficult to choose,

41:08.880 --> 41:11.200
perhaps…
we should take more time to observe,

41:11.280 --> 41:13.880
think it over, and reconsider.

41:16.960 --> 41:18.680
Who are you waiting for, Mr. Yang?

41:20.200 --> 41:25.080
Since the outcome has been decided,
could you please announce the results?

41:30.240 --> 41:31.120
Do we have the outcome?

41:32.600 --> 41:33.920
Yes, yes, we do.

41:35.920 --> 41:39.440
This time, the winner
of the Brocade Weaving Competition

41:39.520 --> 41:41.400
is… the Zhao family…

41:41.480 --> 41:43.880
Everyone, look! There is a kite!

41:45.200 --> 41:46.720
That kite is pretty.

41:48.160 --> 41:50.040
That's pretty.

41:59.120 --> 42:01.400
- Yingying!
- It is Yingying!

42:01.480 --> 42:05.320
- She is here! Ji Yingying!
- Ji Yingying!

42:05.400 --> 42:08.680
- Ji Yingying!
- Ji Yingying!

42:08.760 --> 42:14.520
- Ji Yingying!
- Ji Yingying!

42:21.240 --> 42:23.440
Mother, look at the color of the kite.

42:25.120 --> 42:28.000
Could it be…? Shu Red Silk?

42:28.600 --> 42:31.880
Yes, it is! This is the real Shu Red Silk!

42:38.560 --> 42:41.160
Didn't they say the Ji family
could no longer make Shu Red Silk?

42:41.760 --> 42:45.040
Ji Yingying, where did you get
the Shu Red Silk kite?

42:45.920 --> 42:47.120
We might have lost
the ability to make it before,

42:47.200 --> 42:49.120
but that does not mean
we cannot do it now.

42:49.200 --> 42:50.480
Besides, just because
others cannot recreate it

42:50.560 --> 42:52.560
does not mean I cannot either!

42:54.320 --> 42:56.040
I, Ji Yingying,
representing the Ji family,

42:56.120 --> 42:58.480
present our brocade,
"The Return of Phoenix"!
